DEPENDENCY-DIVISION.
    DEPENDENCY IO.
    DEPENDENCY Strings.

ACTIONABLE Main IS DEFINED AS
*) Arguments supported like this:
*) ARGUMENT-DIVISION.
*)    A IS UNBOUNDED-DICTIONARY.
*)    B IS UNBOUNDED-ARRAY.
*) Return types:
*) WHICH RETURNS UNBOUNDED-STRING.
WHICH EXECUTES
    INVOKE-ACTION Print_Line PROVIDED ARGUMENTS "$S" AND "HELLO, WORLD".
    PERFORMANCE-IMPROVEMENT-PLAN
        I IS INTEGER
    THAT GOES FROM
        0
    TO
        10
    AND INCREMENTS 1
    WHICH EXECUTES
        INVOKE-ACTION Print_Line PROVIDED ARGUMENTS "$S" AND "HELLO, WORLD".
        CIRCLE-BACK.
    PERFORMANCE-IMPROVED.

    *) Returning data:
    *) ESCORT TRUE TO DATA-DIVISION.
 
    *) While loop:
    *) AS LONG AS TRUE HOLDS DO
    *) WHICH EXECUTES
    *)    INVOKE-ACTION Print_Line PROVIDED ARGUMENTS "$S" AND "HELLO, WORLD".
    *)    CIRCLE-BACK.
    *) END-AS-LONG-AS.

    *) Declare a variable:
    *) DATA MY_VARIABLE IS INTEGER.
    *) SYNERGIZES WITH 10.
    STOP-RUN.